OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATrump announces 'Super Intelligence
OL,4,AForce' to oversee AI policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FFederal Trade Commission Chair Andrew
OL,7,FFerguson and Undersecretary of Defense
OL,8,Ffor Research and Engineering Emil
OL,9,FMichael will also be part of the task
OL,10,Fforce.
OL,12,FTrump said last week that he would set
OL,13,Fup a board to oversee AI safety after
OL,14,Ftop tech bosses signed what he
OL,15,Fdescribed as a "morally binding" pact
OL,16,Fto regulate the technology.
